## 2026-09-12 — Accept R1-004 publishable Adapter package

R1-004 protocol-first exact head
`3ce15c7796bd32ecebcb220207fad3ccd03b7834` froze Spec 0058 and the
`ADPKG-001` through `ADPKG-036` corpus before package implementation. That exact
head passed normal CI #685 / run `34574938355` and exact pinned Harness rc5
source-conformance #627 / run `34574938359`, including step 10 pinned-source
typecheck and step 11 real rc5 runtime conformance.

The final reviewed implementation head is
`73ed70fe07d939f02d664162b799e40ff333c02d`. It makes
`@dsh-safe/adapter-dsh@0.1.0-alpha.0` a real ESM package with one public root,
matching declarations, `files: ["dist"]`, the repository Node engine, exact
Cordis 4.0.1 / DSH 0.1.0-rc.5 peers, no install-time scripts, and a real
`pnpm pack` archive audit. The publication build compiles against exact upstream
source commit `47f943859bef60e4160492346772ded9b24f765a`; it does not substitute
rc6, broaden compatibility, or ship Harness source.

