The accepted claim is exactly `PACKAGE_ARTIFACT_VALID`. Current public registry
resolution of the accepted exact rc5 peer coordinate was observed unavailable;
R1-004 therefore does not claim `EXTERNAL_INSTALL_VERIFIED`, does not authorize
rc6 substitution, and does not hide the peer-acquisition problem. R1-005 owns the
external consumer/install-authority proof.

This governance transition is intentionally restricted to CURRENT, this
append-only HISTORY entry and only the R1-004 roadmap acceptance marker/details.
No production source, source-conformance, Spec/corpus/Schema, Shared TCK,
dependency/lockfile state, Harness baseline/workflow, R1-005 implementation,
M5-003+ work, registry state, GitHub Release/tag state or PR merge/readiness
state changes here.

The resulting governance exact head must itself reach normal CI plus exact pinned
Harness rc5 source-conformance dual-green, including step 10 and step 11. Only
after that same exact SHA is dual-green is R1-004 GOVERNANCE CLOSED and R1-005
P0 external-tarball-consumer protocol/design work newly authorized. R1-006+
remains unauthorized; M5-003+ remains paused; registry publish, GitHub Release,
